  "description": "These cardamom-scented milk-based sweets are popular in sweet shops all over India—and are surprisingly easy to make at home.",
  "notes": "Make-ahead and storage: Rasgulla can be made up to three days ahead of serving; store both rasgulla and syrup together in an airtight container in the refrigerator. Once refrigerated, they are best served chilled, as reheating will degrade their quality.",
